{"id":"0aa80b611d62ec1b","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-classical-calculus.md","title":"Classical First-Order Calculus","display":"df-classical-calculus — Classical First-Order Calculus","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-classical-calculus","aliases":["88-df-classical-calculus"],"display":"df-classical-calculus — Classical First-Order Calculus","depends_on":["[[88-df-language]]","[[88-df-formula]]","[[88-df-term]]","[[88-df-variable]]","[[88-df-free-variable]]","[[88-df-substitution]]","[[88-df-inference-rule]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-classical-calculus"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-classical-calculus</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-classical-calculus — Classical First-Order Calculus"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99f4e6abf02e07ae\" href=\"?note=99f4e6abf02e07ae\" title=\"88-df-language\">88-df-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"88-df-term\">88-df-term</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a72f024d8daeb569\" href=\"?note=a72f024d8daeb569\" title=\"88-df-substitution\">88-df-substitution</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Language}(S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Language}(S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Term}_S,\\mathrm{Var}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Term}_S,\\mathrm{Var}_S\\)</span> 与公式缩写见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e14624569ca2194b\" href=\"?note=e14624569ca2194b\" title=\"88-df-formula\">88-df-formula</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b768b53c62ab02de\" href=\"?note=b768b53c62ab02de\" title=\"88-df-term\">88-df-term</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8fb998e5ff14bea3\" href=\"?note=8fb998e5ff14bea3\" title=\"88-df-variable\">88-df-variable</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{free}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{free}_S\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"b642ab331635c77d\" href=\"?note=b642ab331635c77d\" title=\"88-df-free-variable\">88-df-free-variable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a72f024d8daeb569\" href=\"?note=a72f024d8daeb569\" title=\"88-df-substitution\">88-df-substitution</a>；仅在可自由代入时使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi[t/x]\">\\(\\varphi[t/x]\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 是候选二值函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolVal}_S(b)\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolVal}_S(b)\\)</span> 只规定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg,\\land\">\\(\\neg,\\land\\)</span> 的真值行为，不对原子式或以量词为主联结词的公式另加约束。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Taut}_S,\\mathrm{Ax}^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S,R^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Taut}_S,\\mathrm{Ax}^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S,R^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S\\)</span> 分别为命题重言式集、公理模式集、规则关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\\)</span> 是包含该具体演算的规则扩张谓词。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的类型与零前提规则见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a>。推导的前提集是句子集，故下面的概括规则无需对前提中的自由变量另作限制。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"c7ab6c8e893872fb\" href=\"?note=c7ab6c8e893872fb\" title=\"88-df-inference-rule\">88-df-inference-rule</a> 的一元规则关系类型谓词，签名参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 固定。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}classical\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BoolVal}_S(b)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;b:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\{0,1\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\n\\bigl(b(\\neg\\varphi)=1-b(\\varphi)\n\\land b(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=b(\\varphi)b(\\psi)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Taut}_S\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S:\n\\forall b\\;(\\mathrm{BoolVal}_S(b)\\to b(\\varphi)=1)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}classical\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{BoolVal}_S(b)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;b:\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\to\\{0,1\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\;\n\\bigl(b(\\neg\\varphi)=1-b(\\varphi)\n\\land b(\\varphi\\land\\psi)=b(\\varphi)b(\\psi)\\bigr),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Taut}_S\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S:\n\\forall b\\;(\\mathrm{BoolVal}_S(b)\\to b(\\varphi)=1)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}classical\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Ax}^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\mathrm{Taut}_S\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\\{(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\\to\\varphi[t/x]:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\n\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(t,x,\\varphi)\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\\{\\forall x(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\varphi\\to\\forall x\\,\\psi):\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land x\\notin\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\\{(t=u)\\to(\\varphi[t/x]\\to\\varphi[u/x]):\nt,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15em}{}\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(t,x,\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}classical\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Ax}^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\mathrm{Taut}_S\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\\{(\\forall x\\,\\varphi)\\to\\varphi[t/x]:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\n\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(t,x,\\varphi)\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\\{\\forall x(\\varphi\\to\\psi)\\to(\\varphi\\to\\forall x\\,\\psi):\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\land x\\notin\\mathrm{free}_S(\\varphi)\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\\{t=t:t\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\\{(t=u)\\to(\\varphi[t/x]\\to\\varphi[u/x]):\nt,u\\in\\mathrm{Term}_S\\land\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{15em}{}\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(t,x,\\varphi)\\land\\mathrm{FreeFor}_S(u,x,\\varphi)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}classical\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nR^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{\\langle\\langle\\rangle,\\theta\\rangle:\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Ax}^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\varphi,\\varphi\\to\\psi\\rangle,\\psi\\rangle:\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\varphi\\rangle,\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\rangle:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\land R^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S\\subseteq R.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}classical\\text{-}calculus}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nR^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S\\coloneqq{}&amp;\\{\\langle\\langle\\rangle,\\theta\\rangle:\\theta\\in\\mathrm{Ax}^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\varphi,\\varphi\\to\\psi\\rangle,\\psi\\rangle:\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\varphi\\rangle,\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\rangle:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\land R^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S\\subseteq R.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原来的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\)</span> 仍只表示关系类型；空规则关系也满足它。本文件补齐原文所称“标准一阶演算”的实际公理与规则。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\\)</span> 允许附加规则，不声称所有扩张都可靠。</p>\n<p>没有将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sound}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sound}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Complete}\">\\(\\mathrm{Complete}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Provable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Provable}\\)</span> 的定义替换成特定演算。需要经典逻辑的定理另列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}\\)</span> 前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-language","status":"resolved","id":"99f4e6abf02e07ae","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-term","status":"resolved","id":"b768b53c62ab02de","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-term]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-variable","status":"resolved","id":"8fb998e5ff14bea3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-free-variable","status":"resolved","id":"b642ab331635c77d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-free-variable]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-substitution","status":"resolved","id":"a72f024d8daeb569","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-substitution]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-inference-rule","status":"resolved","id":"c7ab6c8e893872fb","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-inference-rule]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"e14624569ca2194b","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Language}(S)$；$\\mathrm{Fml}_S,\\mathrm{Term}_S,\\mathrm{Var}_S$ 与公式缩写见 [[88-df-formula]]、[[88-df-term]]、[[