\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\}\\\\\n&{}\\cup\\{\\langle\\langle\\varphi\\rangle,\\forall x\\,\\varphi\\rangle:\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land x\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)\\land R^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S\\subseteq R.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rule}_S(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sound}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Complete}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Provable}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}","display":false}],"bytes":3531,"backlinks":[{"id":"ceae3257aec622e2","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)$ 的公理与规则包含条件见 [[88-df-classical-calculus]]；仅有 $\\mathrm{Rule}$ 或 $\\mathrm{EffRule}$ 并不提供这些逻辑规则。"},{"id":"4d161ce567387339","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{\\mathcal L_{\\mathrm{arith}}}(R)$ 的公理与规则包含条件见 [[88-df-classical-calculus]]；仅有 $\\mathrm{Rule}$ 或 $\\mathrm{EffRule}$ 并不提供这些逻辑规则。"},{"id":"268c5641ccf6ec59","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S(R)$ 见 [[88-df-classical-calculus]]；对角化使用 [[88-lem-numeral-functional-representation]] 的逐输入唯一输出表示。"},{"id":"855a609cbd7dcf03","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{S}(R)$ 的公理与规则包含条件见 [[88-df-classical-calculus]]；仅有 $\\mathrm{Rule}$ 或 $\\mathrm{EffRule}$ 并不提供这些逻辑规则。"},{"id":"95213b573c0bce18","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"背景为 ZFC。$\\mathrm{Language}(S)$；$R^{\\mathrm{FO}}_S$、$\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_S$ 见 [[88-df-classical-calculus]]。"},{"id":"2aa923dca170bacd","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ClassicalCalc}_{S}(R)$ 的公理与规则包含条件见